window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When we have to make an emergency landing, I didn’t know it would change everything.</p> <p></p> <p>But it becomes clear that I might have made a mistake. As the commander, I do have a target on my back.</p> <p></p> <p>Everyone wants to take my position because how could a woman do what I do?</p> <p></p> <p>It was pretty sexist, and I made sure that they knew it. But then I was taken by him.</p> <p></p> <p>Azulon, an alien from Exodus who is the last of his kind. Someone I never expected to meet.</p> <p></p> <p>He wants me as his mate, doing everything in his power to win me over.</p> <p></p> <p>But the light is revealed on what he has done, and no one trusts him.</p> <p></p> <p>But will they even allow him to stay with me?</p> <p></p> <p>Fake Marriage in Alien Realms is part of a standalone series filled with sexy, possessive alien alphas and their human women who they would do everything for. Filled with sex, passion, drama, and torn feelings, it’s a little bit of everything.</p>"; 
